# Release artifacts (wheel AND sdist) ship only the package code. Since 0.3.0 (the final
# release, a shim over brainmaze-eeg-models) there are no data files: the trained models live
# in brainmaze-eeg-models. This file only keeps setuptools' default sdist extras out. The real
# guard is the shared artifact check (brainmaze-sphinx check-dist.yml, `dist-check: error` in
# ci.yml and release.yml), which fails on anything but Python code.
prune tests
prune docs_src
prune img
prune .github
